WEBVTT

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:02.803
because I remember one of the messages

00:03:02.845 --> 00:03:05.389
I really emphasized
at that press conference

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:07.850
was the need to listen to the voices,

00:03:07.892 --> 00:03:10.228
you know, of different activists
across the world.

00:03:10.269 --> 00:03:11.979
MR: And suddenly, you were cut out.

00:03:11.979 --> 00:03:13.147
VN: Exactly.

00:03:13.147 --> 00:03:17.068
So it was quite disappointing to see
and also frustrating for me.

00:03:17.068 --> 00:03:18.277
But also at that point,

00:03:18.277 --> 00:03:22.365
I just wanted to ask why
I have been removed from the picture.

00:03:22.365 --> 00:03:24.158
And that's exactly what I did.

00:03:24.575 --> 00:03:25.993
I asked why.

00:03:25.993 --> 00:03:30.498
And that really gave me the opportunity
to talk about, you know,